{"book":"1samuel","num":27,"verses":[{"en":"And David said in his heart, I shall now perish one day by the hand of Saul: there is nothing better for me than that I should speedily escape into the land of the Philistines; and Saul shall despair of me, to seek me any more in any coast of Israel: so shall I escape out of his hand.","n":1,"sm":"Tavita i Kata. Ua tuuina atu Sekeleka ia te ia Ua fai ifo Tavita i lona loto, E iu ina Ou oti i se aso i le lima o Saulo; e leai se mea e lelei ia te au na ona ou matua sola i le nuu o Filisitia; ona tuua lea o aʻu e Saulo, e le toe saili ia te au i nuu uma o Isaraelu, ona ou sao ai lea i lona lima.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Kata."},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tuuina"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"Sekeleka"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ifo"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"loto,"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"iu"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"Ou"},{"en":"","sm":"oti"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"lima"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Saulo;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"matua"},{"en":"","sm":"sola"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Filisitia;"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tuua"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Saulo,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"toe"},{"en":"","sm":"saili"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm